  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "和由紫特區一樣使用了全像的\n究極超級錦標賽賽程表！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C75317D2B727953404E006A234F7F75284E86516850CF7684000A7A7669758D857D1A93266A198CFD8CFD7A0B8868FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由我而創、為我而生的錦標賽！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這能讓所有人感到開心，\n真是頂級的企劃、極致的空間呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75316211800C5275300170BA6211800C751F768493266A198CFDFF0100100001BE01000A901980FD8B93624067094EBA611F5230958B5FC3FF0C000A771F662F98027D1A76844F0152833001697581F476847A7A95935462FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像是稜鏡塔的狀況已經到了極限等等，\n這可是密阿雷市的危機呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF662F7A1C93E15854768472C06CC15DF27D9352304E86697596507B497B49FF0C000A901953EF662F5BC6963F96F75E02768453716A5F5462FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要如何讓密阿雷市變得更好，\n我……責任很重大呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898159824F558B935BC6963F96F75E028B8A5F9766F4597DFF0C000A6211202620268CAC4EFB5F8891CD59275462300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要由紫小姐能夠滿足，\n所有事情都能平安落幕……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898175317D2B5C0F59D080FD59206EFF8DB3FF0C000A624067094E8B60C590FD80FD5E735B89843D5E552026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第2屆超級由紫錦標賽……\n我完全不想舉辦也不想出場……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C00325C468D857D1A75317D2B93266A198CFD20262026000A62115B8C51684E0D60F382098FA64E5F4E0D60F351FA58342026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管發生什麼事，都由我來守護。\n不管是由紫小姐……還是大家！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1767C751F4EC09EBC4E8BFF0C90FD753162114F865B888B773002000A4E0D7BA1662F75317D2B5C0F59D0202620269084662F59275BB6FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與由紫小姐相遇的不幸……\n我非常能夠理解。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "820775317D2B5C0F59D076F8904776844E0D5E7820262026000A6211975E5E3880FD5920740689E3300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "應該有適合密阿雷這座城市的\n生命數量的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61C98A726709906954085BC6963F96F790195EA757CE5E027684000A751F547D657891CF768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是覺得寶可夢增加\n就等於療癒增加就是了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F89BA5F975BF653EF5922589E52A0000A5C317B4965BC76427652589E52A05C31662F4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與寶可夢共同生活的城市，\n這可考驗身為訓練家的實力了呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82075BF653EF59225171540C751F6D3B768457CE5E02FF0C000A901953EF80039A578EAB70BA8A137DF45BB676845BE6529B4E86546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐她很明白，\n若要改變城市，實力是不可或缺的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D059795F88660E767DFF0C000A82E5898165398B8A57CE5E02FF0C5BE6529B662F4E0D53EF62167F3A768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要讓各式各樣的人和寶可夢全都感到滿足，\n這種城市怎麼說都辦不到吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818B9354045F0F54046A2376844EBA548C5BF653EF5922516890FD611F52306EFF8DB3FF0C000A90197A2E57CE5E02600E9EBC8AAA90FD8FA64E0D5230542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使辦不到，但讓人覺得有可能辦得到\n這點對大家來說是很重要的啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F8FA64E0D5230FF0C4F468B934EBA89BA5F97670953EF80FD8FA65F975230000A90199EDE5C0D59275BB64F868AAA662F5F8891CD89817684554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所謂的好城市就是便利的城市，對吧？\n我很期待都市開發能做到這件事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408B027684597D57CE5E025C31662F4FBF5229768457CE5E02FF0C5C0D5427FF1F000A62115F88671F5F8590FD5E02958B767C80FD505A523090194EF64E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一回過神就發現和記憶不同……\n城市的變化就是這麼一回事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0056DE904E795E5C31767C73FE548C8A1861B64E0D540C20262026000A57CE5E0276848B8A53165C31662F90199EBC4E0056DE4E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "提供不到位的服務會影響到\n旅館的評價，所以我很緊張。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63D04F9B4E0D52304F4D7684670D52D967035F7197FF5230000A65C5992876848A5550F9FF0C62404EE562115F887DCA5F3530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接待從容不迫的人們\n很輕鬆呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A55F855F9E5BB94E0D8FEB76844EBA5011000A5F888F159B06546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    }
  ],
